{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "79a7c7516cbb6d9caf1b493d746e603c5607a79853e9ff8aa47fe9bfa1dec304", "ja": "（「色んな事を知りたい」と言う星梨花の希望どおり、\nレッスンの合間にオーディションを受けているが……）", "zh": "（为了实现星梨花“想了解各种事情”的愿望，她会在课程间隙参加试镜，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "70b7aa01042b03a9b4f8d67955667f22de3014e61ed29af98013b9cdd049f126", "ja": "星梨花、言いにくいんだけど……\n今回も不合格だった。", "zh": "星梨花，有件事不太好说……\n这次也没通过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "445d6adfe996383c7cc2a486a7a95a9969a646882ffa032c1c8dba790b20635d", "ja": "そうですか……。\n劇場の外でお仕事をするのって、難しいんですね……。", "zh": "这样啊……\n在剧场外工作，真的很难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8424bd8c135b34d3d31d46656c20c423d26326bbebe22d81e4a7a7137788e2ce", "ja": "ああ。けど、星梨花はアイドルを始めたばかりだ。\n勉強だと思って、これからも挑戦していこう。", "zh": "啊。不过，星梨花才刚开始当偶像。\n就当作学习，今后也继续挑战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "d3033f849c9dce8baa5e56914c31cdc93d78a50876f5dc7f93aa733401c19aa3", "ja": "はい、そうですよね。\nこれからも……。", "zh": "是的，确实如此。\n今后也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1005_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e3fdfd803d7b57c69148231751f09015603583a29e2edab056aac1c18d3c8385", "ja": "はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "好的，请进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1008_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "9f9c0477651702043ffa3a37dd2ec540b87e473df2a0c87f00ff0fb3dda1e8e0", "ja": "失礼いたします。", "zh": "打扰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6fd89e854a975632ccf1e67500c319d0b19116b37c6f1a0a7cba01daa816516", "ja": "え！？\n貴方は、星梨花の……。", "zh": "诶！？\n您是，星梨花的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "e0d2ab50c31d13e41c4a92c08005ed52e9e6d3f998b8de700f17f2c4b9830b12", "ja": "パパ！？", "zh": "爸爸！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1011_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "a251d08321a31905c42513efe768920ecbeae915c9f5f3e0ce52a608429a0353", "ja": "{$P$}Pさんでしたね。\nご無沙汰しています。", "zh": "您是{$P$}P先生吧。好久不见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "68640907a25365c0e1ebc3a847ed733d117cfd5e9e6d3f398c95b22e37b69735", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ……。\nオーディションの後に、ご挨拶をして以来ですね。", "zh": "不，彼此彼此……自从试镜后打过招呼以来，就没见过了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "43da58e6815565d22843b2a0ad8be1a5b4ed2f06a08390353d54bc57e78a2f6a", "ja": "パパ、どうして劇場に？\nわたし、何か忘れ物をしたとか……。", "zh": "爸爸，你怎么会来剧场？\n难道是我忘了什么东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1014_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "30917054976af48adcb718def72bff497e625700012565a2d4857219ddd269b6", "ja": "いや、そうじゃないんだ。今日は、\n{$P$}Pさんに話があってね……。", "zh": "不，不是那样的。今天是有件事想和{$P$}P先生谈谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1015_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "6310a13b1ffec86912fbf4baff70f6f6b83a0b95bd7f8e402ed2835fafa8c7ce", "ja": "星梨花のアイドル活動について、妻に聞いたのですが。\nオーディションの結果が、あまり芳しくないそうで。", "zh": "关于星梨花的偶像活动，我问过妻子了。听说试镜的结果不太理想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a07b5733bca6880690adb681809f63c98d5686c5a0856a13f051818b3a6f602f", "ja": "ええ……確かに、苦労しています。でも、\nデビューして間もないですから。これからですよ。", "zh": "是的……确实经历了不少辛苦。不过，毕竟才刚出道不久。今后还有机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1017_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "42a8a3e4e9a0ce8af04f8ed66e3e441185b40844111c5014048e7a301637a268", "ja": "本当に、そうなのでしょうか？", "zh": "真的，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1020_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "fc318c4f0118944115ac06eba5ff9b8be66b3245960268d281489c33d70b7bfa", "ja": "箱崎家として、星梨花の事は大事に育ててきました。\n娘は、優しくて穏やかな子です。", "zh": "作为箱崎家，我们一直很重视对星梨花的培养。\n女儿是个温柔平和的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1021_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "4c1b78a3607771a280b177b00dabf5489e72579ba8ec0a0b40d039b2af6b8924", "ja": "同世代の少女達と、オーディションで競争をするような\n激しい世界が、向いているとは私には思えない。", "zh": "要在选拔中和同龄少女竞争的这种\n残酷世界，我觉得并不适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "eabb23c01c0228eb1918f50333b991e4d9c22059a11aacf6853166c79cd23d96", "ja": "待って、パパ！　オーディションに落ちても、\nチャンスがなくなったわけじゃないの！", "zh": "等一下，爸爸！就算试镜没通过，\n也不代表机会就没有了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "89a1aa4f9df420702124cd1393eba9c50c03ea308c11123271d99b01cc8b4781", "ja": "落ちちゃっても、受けたのと\n違う役がもらえることだってあるし。それに……。", "zh": "就算落选了，也有可能拿到和试镜时不同的角色。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "29a34b3a77b7354d222408f284da0aabde183ae97b303ce450c3b14c59decd2d", "ja": "まずは顔を覚えてもらうことが大切なんだって、\n{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "听{$P$}先生说，首先要让别人记住自己的脸才是最重要的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1025_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "16b5d190ccbca864f80d9cdff1bca4cbc55f62dee5e7ac7803fdd99be3d204e2", "ja": "言いたいことはわかる。でも、星梨花。\nやっぱりアイドルは、辞めたほうがいいと思うんだ。", "zh": "我明白你想说什么。但是，星梨花。\n我还是觉得，你最好别再当偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1026_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "17e7a6f64919b7a40c5b1c387dffc54aa3515524f778fe795153d99523295270", "ja": "星梨花はまだ中学生だ。やれる事は他にもあるし……\nお前が傷付くところを、パパは見たくないんだよ。", "zh": "星梨花还只是初中生。还有其他能做的事……爸爸不想看到你受伤啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "981dfc9606b5acc56347e2060357cfe40b90470d5a20fd5d2b58f18295890271", "ja": "パパなんて……パパなんて、嫌い！", "zh": "爸爸什么的……爸爸什么的，我讨厌你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1028_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "be4ee929ed9f747edf9b4553d1465eac04b31212c1e5e4e2cb0bbcdffecd54da", "ja": "！　星梨花！", "zh": "！星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "6235c65b1ef093c6f75b45015374165ceefba7cb0139060c7568790b42427af8", "ja": "パパはそうやって、すぐわたしのことを子供扱いして！\nわたしはもう、中学生なんだよ！", "zh": "爸爸总是这样，动不动就把我当小孩子！\n我已经是中学生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "643605efaf2a8b400865d66dd91bb34807afd42d2d5d3320faf323bd4b3a0018", "ja": "アイドルになるって決めたのは、わたしなんだから！\nやりたいことくらい、自分で決めさせて！", "zh": "既然是我自己决定要成为偶像的！\n至少想做什么，就让我自己决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "f154f04bbce09f77a257e3eec5c33e875b12546d772460417a473554c4cb8a0c", "ja": "オーディションだって……オーディションだって、\nいつか絶対、合格してみせるんだから！", "zh": "试镜……试镜的话，\n总有一天我一定会通过给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1032_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "e5034511075cc50a40ec70e31f7651d88d97652dbac462c00d76c9ff313170e3", "ja": "星梨花！\nパパは、星梨花のためを思って……！", "zh": "星梨花！\n爸爸也是为星梨花着想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "b7c8f5c1528cdd547ce9165458b3a75d7b729b871327d0e7688e4504dbdbf2ce", "ja": "わたしの気持ちを無視してるのに、\nそれが、どうしてわたしのためなの！？", "zh": "明明都无视了我的感受，\n这怎么能说是为了我好呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1034_p", "source_sha256": "a4024d1693512422cba7f2072df0aa19bcee8959d446d7c540fe7482436f94c2", "ja": "星梨花、言い過ぎだぞ。\n……箱崎さんも、落ち着いてください。", "zh": "星梨花，说得有点过分了。\n……箱崎小姐，也请冷静一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6eeb343c25fbbd8b6a1c9b2438a3b00f52a0f186112d25a9464330314a32c877", "ja": "星梨花。お父さんは、本当に星梨花の事を\n心配して言ってるんだ。それはわかるな？", "zh": "星梨花。爸爸是真的在担心你，才会这么说。这个你明白吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c1fac7ece05c635834b827d11c0445de4b0b26b9eeb57baf6e083712fb9f289", "ja": "……はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1037_p", "source_sha256": "47035be4b6b34d3df126032275e3e314eb0577580b1e4e1a08987e51445567cb", "ja": "箱崎さん。娘さんの事、ご心配かと思います。ですが\n本人が納得するまで、挑戦させていただけませんか？", "zh": "箱崎女士，您应该很担心女儿的事。不过，\n能否让她挑战到本人心满意足为止呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7dc6a7f458ca7a67b2aa9b764d550e2604071884fd896f4a63c3d248d52df00e", "ja": "本人に、これだけのやる気があるんです。\n無理に止めたところで、後悔しか残らないと思います。", "zh": "她本人有这么强的干劲。\n就算勉强阻止她，我想最后也只会留下后悔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "5df88fba8491d556b2b1d7ebac3869152aafdf1aaacb53a1d2b8a222636a94ca", "ja": "パパ……。", "zh": "爸爸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1041_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "a3f14b7b33041893ffc2d1c1a5c878a3042474c79633b136c6287271ae6d2f8d", "ja": "……わかった。\n悔いがないようにしなさい。", "zh": "……我知道了。\n别让自己留下遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "67a12fbdfb103e7375a097ed631f6b15fa952104586ab1fe31d6d968ae71b8dd", "ja": "！？　ありがとう、パパ！", "zh": "！？谢谢你，爸爸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1043_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "b74569f37a53501823e33045393bae0c1f3f295b039fe8e2e7dd163236714785", "ja": "ただし、危険な事や過激な事はしないように！\nもし危ない目にあったりしたら……。", "zh": "不过，可别做危险或过激的事！要是遇到危险的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ab325a9a83ccde7cc2ddf84d7b5b8002e8b67e1e5b4c5854b80f4f511ce263b3", "ja": "わかりました。娘さんの事は、\n責任を持ってお預かりさせていただきます。", "zh": "明白了。令嫒就交给我吧，\n我一定会负起责任照顾好她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1045_serikatiti", "source_sha256": "dbc0e0afe126e1759d7fba4c99459d902278d8dee76ec16f62c8f72e408af3e3", "ja": "……改めて、娘をよろしくお願いします。\n失礼します。", "zh": "……再次拜托您照顾我女儿了。\n失礼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "c9285d1ca8ce9152232ba13ed74fcfe56d441adea4366d4a912cbb3b909d9920", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nパパを説得してくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n谢谢您说服爸爸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1048_p", "source_sha256": "60cd22706e2bd394ab3de2bb907b4c072f8dbf7d56224de438596471f98d4918", "ja": "それも、星梨花が毎日頑張ってるからだよ。お父さんに\n安心してもらうためにも、これからも頑張らないとな！", "zh": "那也是因为星梨花每天都在努力啊。为了让你爸爸放心，\n今后也得继续努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_005_1049_022ser", "source_sha256": "02886226e80ec74684d7540ec9fe40ff43d0a79f1a05303b5e2ad69b5b6a7562", "ja": "はい！　次のオーディションは、\n合格できるようにがんばりますね！", "zh": "好的！为了能通过下一次试镜，我会继续加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
